{"headword":"נָטַע","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. plant (</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, and deriv.; cf. Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">נטעת</span> <em>pavilion</em> [? as planted, established] DHM<sup> ZMG xxxvii. (1883), 337, 349</sup><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:6\" href=\"/Numbers.24.6\">Nu 24:6</a> +, 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָטָ֑עְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.11\">Dt 6:11</a>, sf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְטַעְתָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.2\">Je 12:2</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָטַ֫עְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 45:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.45.4\">Je 45:4</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנָטַעְתִּ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.10\">Je 42:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.5\">Ec 2:5</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְטַעְתִּיךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.21\">Je 2:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וּנְטַעְתִּיו</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.10\">2 S 7:10</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">וּנְטַעְתִּיהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.9\">1 Ch 17:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וּנְטַעְתִּים</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:15\" href=\"/Amos.9.15\">Am 9:15</a> + 2 times, etc.; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִטַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:45\" href=\"/Daniel.11.45\">Dn 11:45</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּטַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:8\" href=\"/Genesis.2.8\">Gn 2:8</a> + 2 times, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּטָּעֵ֫הוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.2\">Is 5:2</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּטַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.21\">Dt 16:21</a> + 2 times, sf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּטָּעֶ֑הָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:9\" href=\"/Psalms.80.9\">ψ 80:9</a>; sf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּטָּעֵ֫מוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:17\" href=\"/Exodus.15.17\">Ex 15:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּטָּעֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:3\" href=\"/Psalms.44.3\">ψ 44:3</a>, etc.; Imv. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִטְעוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.5\">Je 29:5</a> + 3 times; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְטֹעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.16\">Is 51:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.9\">Je 18:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לִנְטוֹעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.10\">Je 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.28\">31:28</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָטַעַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.2\">Ec 3:2</a>; Pt. act. <span dir=\"rtl\">נוֹטֵעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.17\">Je 11:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נֹטַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:9\" href=\"/Psalms.94.9\">ψ 94:9</a> (shewing orig. <em>a</em> according to Lag<sup>BN 84</sup>); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נֹטְעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.5\">Je 31:5</a>; pass. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָטוּעַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.2\">Ec 3:2</a>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְטוּעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.11\">Ec 12:11</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>plant</em>, c. acc. of tree or vine <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:6\" href=\"/Numbers.24.6\">Nu 24:6</a> (JE; subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:33\" href=\"/Genesis.21.33\">Gn 21:33</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.23\">Lv 19:23</a> (H), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.14\">Is 44:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:16\" href=\"/Psalms.106.16\">ψ 106:16</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.5\">Ec 2:5</a> also (fig. of people) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.21\">Je 2:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.17\">11:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:9\" href=\"/Psalms.80.9\">ψ 80:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:16\" href=\"/Psalms.80.16\">16</a>; c. acc. of vineyard <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:20\" href=\"/Genesis.9.20\">Gn 9:20</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Amos 5:11\" href=\"/Amos.5.11\">Am 5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:14\" href=\"/Amos.9.14\">9:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:29\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.29\">2 K 19:29</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.30\">Is 37:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:13\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.13\">Zp 1:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 20:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.20.6\">Dt 20:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:30\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.30\">28:30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:39\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.39\">39</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.5\">Je 31:5</a><sup>(×3)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 35:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.35.7\">35:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.26\">Ez 28:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.21\">Is 65:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.16\">Pr 31:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:37\" href=\"/Psalms.107.37\">ψ 107:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:4\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.4\">Ec 2:4</a>; olive trees and vineyards <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.11\">Dt 6:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:13\" href=\"/Joshua.24.13\">Jos 24:13</a> (D); garden <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:8\" href=\"/Genesis.2.8\">Gn 2:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(י׳)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.5\">Je 29:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 29:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.29.28\">28</a>; so c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֵׁרָה כָּל־עֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.21\">Dt 16:21</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ נִטְעֵי נַעֲמָנִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.10\">Is 17:10</a> (fig. of idolatry); abs. (lit.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 65:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.65.22\">Is 65:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 3:2\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.3.2\">Ec 3:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָקַר</span>); c. 2 acc. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.2\">Is 5:2</a> (<em>plant vineyard</em> with <em>vine</em>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>plant</em>, fig. = establish, usually of establishing people, c. acc. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.10\">2 S 17:10</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.9\">1 Ch 17:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Amos 9:15\" href=\"/Amos.9.15\">Am 9:15</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.36\">Ez 36:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:17\" href=\"/Exodus.15.17\">Ex 15:17</a> (song), especially <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 24:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.24.6\">Je 24:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 32:41\" href=\"/Jeremiah.32.41\">32:41</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ב</span> loc.), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 42:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.42.10\">42:10</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַשׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:10\" href=\"/Psalms.45.10\">45:10</a> (opp. <em>id.</em>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 44:3\" href=\"/Psalms.44.3\">ψ 44:3</a> (all of establishing Isr.); of establishing wicked <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.2\">Je 12:2</a>; abs. of establishing people <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.10\">Je 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.9\">18:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:28\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.28\">31:28</a>; more lit., <em>establish</em> heavens <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.16\">Is 51:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לִיסֹד אֶרֶץ</span>); <em>plant</em> i.e. fix (late use) tents <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:45\" href=\"/Daniel.11.45\">Dn 11:45</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַשְׂמְרוֹת נְטוּעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:11\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.11\">Ec 12:11</a> <em>nails planted</em>, i.e. fixed in; even <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ אֹזֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:9\" href=\"/Psalms.94.9\">ψ 94:9</a> <em>he that planted</em> the <em>ear</em>."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִמָּ֑עוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.24\">Is 40:24</a> <em>be planted</em>, fig., = be established."}],"form":"Niph."}]},"rid":"BDB06274","strong_numbers":["5193"],"next_hw":"נֶ֫טַע","prev_hw":"נָטִיל","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["5749"],"TWOT":["1354"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}